## Season priorities (2025-26)
Nick authored a LIMSOC season priorities proposal for 2025-26, positioning himself as the volunteer
leader pitching the rest of the team for adoption. Structured as problem / proposed change / impact
per project. 18 projects across 4 focus areas. See `project_limsoc_season_priorities.md` for the raw record.

Themes: Simplification, Cohesion, AI Innovation (LIMSOC framed as agile greenfield startup/scale-up vs legacy ESO incumbents).

Focus areas:
1. Enhance Incident Management (target Sep 2025) — 8 projects: incident categorisation, simplified creation, secondary info forms, AI brief, ETA on responding services, prompting on information, notification simplification, incident labels.
2. More Information on Front Line (target Sep 2025) — 3 projects: implied access, patrol map, incident info for ERT members.
3. Volunteer Rostering (target Aug 2025) — 4 projects: team rostering, flexible rostering / shift bid, unit-level admin, sign-off reminders.
4. Data Integrity and Reporting (target Oct 2025) — 3 projects: PDF reporting, AI assistance on incidents, AI assistance on first aid forms.

